---
// Override of Starlight's ThemeProvider. Arithmetica is deliberately light /
// "paper"-first (Ink & Copper), and its CSS only themes :root[data-theme='light'].
// The stock provider reads localStorage / prefers-color-scheme and can set
// data-theme='dark', leaving Starlight's dark navy surfaces paired with the
// site's dark ink text (the "black text on dark blue" bug). We force light and
// drop the picker-sync entirely. Inlined to avoid FOUC, same as the original.
---

<script is:inline>
  // Always light: no localStorage, no prefers-color-scheme.
  document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'light';
  // Keep the global that other Starlight scripts may call, as a no-op.
  window.StarlightThemeProvider = { updatePickers() {} };
</script>
